  m_text: 'Head Soccer is a 2D arcade football game developed by

    <color=#FFD133>Tomer
    Yad Shalom</color> and <color=#FFD133>Guy Yad Shalom</color>.

    We built this
    game out of our love for football games and a desire to

    recreate the fun
    and chaos of the original Head Soccer, with our own twist.'
